<title>POLAND: Clinton leaves Poland for Romania.</title>
<headline>Clinton leaves Poland for Romania.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton left Poland for Romania on Friday after a brief visit to mark NATO's invitation this week to Poland, Hungary and the Czech Republic to start NATO entry negotiations.</p>
<p>A U.S. embassy official at Warsaw's Okecie airport said Clinton's jet took off at 8.57 a.m. (0657 GMT).</p>
